msgstr "%(file)s: el servidor ha enviat %(actual)d bytes d'un interval de %(expected)d bytes."

msgid "Run the command again; the parts that did arrive are kept."
msgstr "Torneu a executar l'ordre; les parts que han arribat es conserven."

